{
	title: 'Command help',
	spec: 'tsk, tsk help, tsk --help, and tsk -h show concise usage, the package version, and every command and feature (including add-note, edit, del, tree and foldable), and point to tsk --detailed-help. Detailed help explains the full task and project structure, every supported field (spec, not description), notes and files, and the reset/fold/ready rebuild workflow with concise examples. tsk <command> --help gives command-specific usage, options, and examples. Help never runs commands or requires a Tsk project; describe human output defaults and structured formats.',
